:R-HSA-1187000  a           obo:GO_0007338 , owl:NamedIndividual ;
        rdfs:comment        "Mammalian fertilization comprises sperm migration through the female reproductive tract, biochemical and morphological changes to sperm, and sperm-egg interaction in the oviduct. Although the broad concepts of fertilization are well defined, our understanding of the biochemical mechanisms underlying sperm-egg binding is limited." ;
